{
  "job_B3.2.34_20251003_114632": {
    "chunk_text": "Men \u00f0a leofestan, us gedafena\u00fe \u00e6rest \u00fe\u00e6t we gemunen & gereccen be Gode \u00e6lmihtigum, \u00fee geworhte Ealle \u00fery, se f\u00e6der & se sunu & se haliga gast, w\u00e6ron \u00e6fre efenece & \u00e6fre beo\u00f0, & hie \u00fery an God Fram \u00feam, \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6ne & on \u00feam syndon geworhte ealle \u00fea \u00feinc \u00fee gesewene syndon & ealle \u00fea \u00fee \u00c6rest on frym\u00fee he geworhte heofonas & eor\u00f0an & s\u00e6 & ealle \u00fea \u00feinc \u00fee on him syndon, & ealle \u00fea & ealle \u00fea \u00f0e of englum to deoflum forsceapene wurdon, ealle he hie of him sylfum mid his oro\u00f0e ut & ealle \u00fea \u00f0e \u00e6t \u00f0am r\u00e6de mid him w\u00e6ron & him \u00e6fter besawon, ealle hie wurdon of englum to Sy\u00f0\u00f0an he geworhte of eor\u00f0an lame \u00feone \u00e6restan man \u00fee \u00e6fre w\u00e6s, \u00feone he be naman Adam nemde, & him ealle eor\u00f0an gesceafta on geweald sealde & s\u00e6s fixas, \u00fe\u00e6t hie him hyrsumian sceoldon. & he him eallum naman gesceop, \u00e6g\u00f0er ge nytenum ge fugelum ge fixum, & hie ealle gyt be \u00f0am & dryhten \u00e6lmihtig of Adames wynstran sidan genam \u00fe\u00e6t ribb \u00fee he \u00fe\u00e6t wif ofgeworhte \u00fee Eua hatte. Of \u00f0am twam \u00feurh Godes mihte is ealles middangeardes folc framcumen. & him God forgeaf \u00fe\u00e6t hie ealles geweald agan moston \u00fee on eor\u00f0an w\u00e6re, butan anes treowes bleda \u00de\u00e6t",
